  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Finger_items\" title=\"Category:Finger items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Finger.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ring_of_Spell_Storing\">Ring of Spell Storing</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #FFBBBB solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#FFBBBB;--bg-color-1-dark:#573F3F;--bg-color-2:#FFE4E1;--bg-color-2-dark:#3D2C2A;--header-color:#FFBBBB;--header-color-dark:#573F3F;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\">11\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Ring_Generic_Silver.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Ring_Generic_Silver.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Jewelry / Ring\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Finger\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>, <a href=\"/page/Exclusive\" title=\"Exclusive\">Exclusive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">120\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a>:</b> <b>Gold</b> is an expensive precious metal often used in jewellery. Unfortunately, it is very fragile, and often has low hardness.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"450\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0004420000</span>4,420<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sands_of_Menechtarun\" title=\"Sands of Menechtarun\">Sands of Menechtarun</a></b>, Undead Area: <a href=\"/page/General_Tanankh\" title=\"General Tanankh\">General Tanankh</a>'s chest (Rare Encounter)&#160;; <br /> <a href=\"/page/Masei_Mkembe\" title=\"Masei Mkembe\">Masei Mkembe</a> sells for 625 <a href=\"/page/Antique_Bronze_Tokens\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Antique Bronze Tokens\">Antique Bronze Tokens</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Store\" title=\"Spell Store\">Spell Store </a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Store\" title=\"Spell Store\">Spell Store </a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 4<br /><b>Charges: </b>3 (3/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 3 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:3)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Desert&#39;s_Biting_Sands\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Desert's Biting Sands</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Desert&#39;s_Biting_Sands\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Desert's Biting Sands</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+2% Artifact bonus to Force Spellcrit Chance<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Force Spellpower<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Magical Resistance Rating Cap</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Ring_of_Spell_Storing.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Ring_of_Spell_Storing.png/420px-Ring_of_Spell_Storing.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"503\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Ring_of_Spell_Storing.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Ring_of_Spell_Storing\" title=\"Item:Epic Ring of Spell Storing\">Epic Ring of Spell Storing</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This ring is capable of storing the magical energy necessary to cast spells. When the ring is activated the wearer's store of power is replenished enough to cast a Level 4 Spell.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><b>Spell Store</b> restores 5sp + 5sp per caster level of item.\n</p>\n<ul><li>For most classes this means you can get back 25 spell points per click.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Artificer\" title=\"Artificer\">Artificers</a> receive an additional +5 for each stack of <a href=\"/page/Artificer_Knowledge\" title=\"Artificer Knowledge\">Artificer Knowledge</a> - Wondrous items.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Arcanotechnician_enhancements\" title=\"Arcanotechnician enhancements\">Arcanotechnicians</a> with capstone use the item at caster level 20, recovering 105 spell points per click.</li></ul>\n<p>Pre-U17 versions remain ML11. Newly looted ones are ML9.  Back to ML11 as of U50.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816182144\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.124 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2789/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19770/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6203/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n125.08%  135.534     36 Template:IO\n100.00%  108.354      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  108.354      1 -total\n 97.41%  105.550      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 43.42%   47.043      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 42.06%   45.572      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 40.16%   43.515      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 38.96%   42.214      2 Template:InCategory\n 18.76%   20.324      1 Template:Mat\n 18.45%   19.990      4 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:8481-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816182144 and revision id 634263. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
